Q: How do I start chanting?
Sources: Heart Dharma Intro (EN) | Heart Dharma Intro (EN) | Heart Dharma Intro (EN) · types: introduction,xiaofangzi_guide,qa_metaphysics,qa_general
  ✓ names at least one sutra/mantra
