Work troubles wear a person down — I'm sorry you're going through this 🙏

To your question: in Master Lu's teachings, difficulties in career are often connected to karmic obstacles, though not always in a simple one-to-one way.

Master Lu explained it this way in *Metaphysics Q&A Vol. 2*:

> The more black energy patches there are on the body, the more unpleasant experiences with health, career and relationships this person would be having.

So yes — karma can show up as blockages at work. But this isn't meant as bad news. Karmic obstacles can be reduced. That's the whole point of the practice. Blaming ourselves or fate doesn't help; doing something about it does.

A simple way to begin:

📿 **Great Compassion Mantra** — 3 times daily
Before reciting, say: "May Greatly Merciful and Greatly Compassionate Guan Yin Bodhisattva bless me, [your full name], with good health and strengthened spiritual energy."

📿 **Heart Sutra** — 3 times daily
Before reciting, say: "May Greatly Merciful and Greatly Compassionate Guan Yin Bodhisattva bless me, [your full name], to open my wisdom, keep my mind clear and calm, and remove my worries."
(Please don't recite the Heart Sutra after 10pm.)

If you don't know how to recite them, you can follow along with the guided videos here:
🔗 https://xinlingfamen.info/jingwen/

Start with these two and keep it steady. Once you're comfortable, we can add the Cundi Mantra, which Master Lu taught for helping matters come through smoothly — including work and career.

One thing worth saying plainly: don't chant with the attitude of "let me test this and see." Master Lu taught **faith, vow, practice** — believe first, then act. Keep going consistently, and let Guan Yin Bodhisattva arrange the timing.

May I ask — have you recited any sutras before, or is this completely new to you? That way I can suggest what suits you best 🙏

